---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Andrew McLeod" description="Thirty years in brand and marketing. Every shift in the industry. Andrew McLeod, founder of GreaterThan.">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero hero--sub section--indigo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-hero-inner">
      <div class="hero__inner">
        <h1>Thirty years in brand and marketing. Every shift in the industry</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="about-photo">
        <span>Photo</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BACKGROUND -->
<section class="about-content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">Background</h2>
    <p class="reveal d1">Andrew McLeod came to brand and advertising in 1996, when the internet was still new and brand was what you owned, not what you managed. Twenty years at senior strategic level in brand and advertising agencies took him through every major shift the industry has had: broadcast, web, digital, social and AI.</p>
    <p class="reveal d2">From 1996 to 2022, the thread was always the same: brand as the foundation. That's where a business's goals meet an audience's needs. Everything else, including campaign, channel, content, AI and automation, is an expression of that relationship. Without brand at the centre, marketing becomes activity. With it, every dollar compounds.</p>
    <p class="reveal d2">In July 2022, he stepped out of agency to lead GreaterThan as an independent practice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Want to work <em>together</em>?</h2>
      <div class="cta-band__right">
        <span class="cta-band__email">hello@wearegreaterthan.co.nz</span>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary-dark">Book a discovery call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
